ally impartial of you. How can a Werewolf as greedy and malicious as AA-12 not pay her own price?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"How about this. I will cast more votes for you. In exchange, give me that chili powder. Deal?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Gr G28 and Gr G36 look at each other."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G36","expression":8,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr G36","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well, if that's Master's order, then I'm willing to obey."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Gr G36 respectfully hands the Commander the chili powder."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"And AA-12's neural cloud, please..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G28","expression":4,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,130"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr G28","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hehe, I've already unlocked it!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"As soon as Gr G28 finishes her sentence, AA-12 clenches her fists and slowly raises her head. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Her eyes, ladened with dark circles, gradually regain their shimmering light."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AA12","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AA-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Wha... what happened? Is everything over?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Do you feel unwell, AA-12? Is anything wrong?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"AA-12 scratches her head and looks around in confusion."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AA12","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AA-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hmm... Did I just... fall asleep?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Gr G36 and Gr G28 quickly exchange glances, then simultaneously turn their attention back onto the Commander."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ah... well... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah, that's right! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Earlier, Gr G36 and Gr G28 came to me and said you just passed out! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Neural cloud crashes or something like that! So... ehm... I came to make sure you're okay."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander lies uncomfortably, staring right at AA-12's eyes. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"AA-12 slowly scratches her head again."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AA12","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AA-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Is that so? Well, I'm sorry for that. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I knew these resort islands aren't my thing... That damn sun caused me to lose sleep for a few days. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Huh? Why are there so many ice creams... Did something happen earlier?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well... that's..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander smiles awkwardly, and Gr G36 sends a hasty glance at Gr G28 out the corner of her eyes."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G28","expression":4,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,130"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr G28","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ah! I almost forgot! Sis Gr G36, the kitchen's been asking us to hurry up and get back! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"AA-12, these desserts are our gifts, so feel free to enjoy them!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G36","expression":18,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr G36","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We'll take our leave now. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Have a good night, Master... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And please don't forget to honor our agreement."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"G28","expression":4,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,130"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Gr G28","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hehe... see you later! Don't forget about it, Commander!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Both Gr G28 and Gr G36 leave behind a profound smirk, then dash out of the stall at breakneck speed."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AA12","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AA-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander, what's that agreement about? Is it related to me?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ah... N-no it's not! It's just some personal stuff, you see..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander looks around, hoping to find something that can save them from embarrassment. Their eyes land on a gaming console sitting on the table."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ah! Looks like you got a lot of fun games! Let's play for a bit!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"AA-12 frowns."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AA12","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AA-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Eh, whatever... If you really want to, I guess we could play for a bit. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Hold on, let me check what the manual says again..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AA12","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,100"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Your stall is really all over the place."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AA12","expression":2,"side":"left","tags":{"Position":"0,100"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AA-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's the best I can do, Commander. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Oh yeah, don't forget to vote for me... Ew, that was disgusting to spew out. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Anyway, it's Five-seven who told me to say that, so the rest is up to you. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Alright, Twilight Labyrinth is now ready for you!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePoint","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
